安装后请确认 `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json` 中的 `dsh.profile.bundles` 数组已包含 `gongwen-skill`：

```jsonc
{
  "name": "dsh-profile-web",
  "private": true,
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-base": "...",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app": "...",
    "gongwen-skill": "^2.12.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-base",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app",
        "gongwen-skill"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
